OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,6,Fmixed weekend with bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells on Saturday, then overnight fog
OL,8,Freturns. Turning cloudier on Sunday
OL,9,Fwith some light rain before long
OL,10,Fspells of sunshine return Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
